  '© Firma · Impressum · Datenschutz': '© Company · Legal notice · Privacy',
  'Legt ein neues Board an – leer, aus einer Vorlage (template: mindmap, flowchart, journey, funnel, sales, org, swot, kanban, wireframe, social), aus Mermaid-Text oder direkt mit Elementen. team_access: edit (Standard), view oder none (privat). Elemente (JSON, Koordinaten in px, x/y = links oben, y wächst nach unten):\n- Formen: {type:"rect"|"ellipse"|"diamond", x, y, w, h, text?, fill?, stroke?, strokeWidth?, radius?, fontSize?, bold?, color?, sketch?:true (handgezeichnet)}\n- Notiz: {type:"sticky", text, fill? (#fff3a3 gelb, #ffc9de rosa, #c5e4ff blau, #c3f0c8 grün, #e5dbff lila, #ffd8a8 orange)}\n- Text: {type:"text", text, fontSize?, bold?, align?:"left"|"center"|"right", w? (Umbruchbreite)}\n- Pfeil/Linie: {type:"arrow"|"line", from: ref|id, to: ref|id, text? (Beschriftung), route?:"straight"|"elbow"|"curved", endHead?:"arrow"|"triangle"|"none", strokeStyle?:"dashed"} – bleibt an den Formen haften\n- Rahmen/Artboard: {type:"frame", name, preset?:"desktop"|"mobile"|"tablet"|"social-square"|"social-portrait"|"social-landscape"|"story"|"a4"|"slide", w, h} – Inhalte mit in: ref|id\n- Icon: {type:"icon", icon:"rocket"|"user"|"mail"|"phone"|"calendar-days"|"star"|"target"|"zap"|"lightbulb"|"euro"|"chart-column"|… , w, h, stroke?}\n- Tabelle: {type:"table", cells:[["Kopf1","Kopf2"],["a","b"]], header?:true, w, h}\n- Diagramm: {type:"chart", chart:{kind:"bar"|"line"|"area"|"pie"|"donut", title?, labels:[…], series:[{name, values:[…]}]}, w?, h?}\n- Live-CRM-Karte: {type:"card", card:{kind:"contact"|"company"|"deal"|"task"|"ticket"|"appointment"|"project"|"report"|"pipeline", id}} (pipeline = ganzes Board mit Stufen)\n- Bild: {type:"image", src:"/uploads/…" (aus der Mediathek), w, h}\nPlatzierung ohne Koordinaten: ref:"a" vergibt einen Namen; at:{right_of|left_of|below|above: ref|id, gap?} legt neben ein Element; in: ref|id setzt in einen Rahmen; ganz ohne Angabe ordnen sich neue Elemente rechts neben dem Inhalt an (oder per layout).': 'Creates a new board – empty, from a template (template: mindmap, flowchart, journey, funnel, sales, org, swot, kanban, wireframe, social), from Mermaid text or directly with elements. team_access: edit (default), view or none (private). Elements (JSON, coordinates in px, x/y = top left, y grows downwards):\n- Shapes: {type:"rect"|"ellipse"|"diamond", x, y, w, h, text?, fill?, stroke?, strokeWidth?, radius?, fontSize?, bold?, color?, sketch?:true (hand-drawn)}\n- Sticky note: {type:"sticky", text, fill? (#fff3a3 yellow, #ffc9de pink, #c5e4ff blue, #c3f0c8 green, #e5dbff purple, #ffd8a8 orange)}\n- Text: {type:"text", text, fontSize?, bold?, align?:"left"|"center"|"right", w? (wrap width)}\n- Arrow/line: {type:"arrow"|"line", from: ref|id, to: ref|id, text? (label), route?:"straight"|"elbow"|"curved", endHead?:"arrow"|"triangle"|"none", strokeStyle?:"dashed"} – stays attached to the shapes\n- Frame/artboard: {type:"frame", name, preset?:"desktop"|"mobile"|"tablet"|"social-square"|"social-portrait"|"social-landscape"|"story"|"a4"|"slide", w, h} – content with in: ref|id\n- Icon: {type:"icon", icon:"rocket"|"user"|"mail"|"phone"|"calendar-days"|"star"|"target"|"zap"|"lightbulb"|"euro"|"chart-column"|… , w, h, stroke?}\n- Table: {type:"table", cells:[["Header1","Header2"],["a","b"]], header?:true, w, h}\n- Chart: {type:"chart", chart:{kind:"bar"|"line"|"area"|"pie"|"donut", title?, labels:[…], series:[{name, values:[…]}]}, w?, h?}\n- Live CRM card: {type:"card", card:{kind:"contact"|"company"|"deal"|"task"|"ticket"|"appointment"|"project"|"report"|"pipeline", id}} (pipeline = whole board with stages)\n- Image: {type:"image", src:"/uploads/…" (from the media library), w, h}\nPlacement without coordinates: ref:"a" gives an element a name; at:{right_of|left_of|below|above: ref|id, gap?} places it next to an element; in: ref|id puts it into a frame; with no placement at all, new elements line up to the right of the existing content (or via layout).',
  'Fügt mehrere Elemente auf einmal hinzu (bis 1000). Pfeile verbinden Formen über from/to (ref oder id). layout ordnet die neuen Formen automatisch an: {kind:"flow"|"tree"|"mindmap"|"radial"|"grid", direction?:"right"|"down"}. origin {x,y} setzt die linke obere Ecke. Gibt refs → ids zurück. Elemente (JSON, Koordinaten in px, x/y = links oben, y wächst nach unten):\n- Formen: {type:"rect"|"ellipse"|"diamond", x, y, w, h, text?, fill?, stroke?, strokeWidth?, radius?, fontSize?, bold?, color?, sketch?:true (handgezeichnet)}\n- Notiz: {type:"sticky", text, fill? (#fff3a3 gelb, #ffc9de rosa, #c5e4ff blau, #c3f0c8 grün, #e5dbff lila, #ffd8a8 orange)}\n- Text: {type:"text", text, fontSize?, bold?, align?:"left"|"center"|"right", w? (Umbruchbreite)}\n- Pfeil/Linie: {type:"arrow"|"line", from: ref|id, to: ref|id, text? (Beschriftung), route?:"straight"|"elbow"|"curved", endHead?:"arrow"|"triangle"|"none", strokeStyle?:"dashed"} – bleibt an den Formen haften\n- Rahmen/Artboard: {type:"frame", name, preset?:"desktop"|"mobile"|"tablet"|"social-square"|"social-portrait"|"social-landscape"|"story"|"a4"|"slide", w, h} – Inhalte mit in: ref|id\n- Icon: {type:"icon", icon:"rocket"|"user"|"mail"|"phone"|"calendar-days"|"star"|"target"|"zap"|"lightbulb"|"euro"|"chart-column"|… , w, h, stroke?}\n- Tabelle: {type:"table", cells:[["Kopf1","Kopf2"],["a","b"]], header?:true, w, h}\n- Diagramm: {type:"chart", chart:{kind:"bar"|"line"|"area"|"pie"|"donut", title?, labels:[…], series:[{name, values:[…]}]}, w?, h?}\n- Live-CRM-Karte: {type:"card", card:{kind:"contact"|"company"|"deal"|"task"|"ticket"|"appointment"|"project"|"report"|"pipeline", id}} (pipeline = ganzes Board mit Stufen)\n- Bild: {type:"image", src:"/uploads/…" (aus der Mediathek), w, h}\nPlatzierung ohne Koordinaten: ref:"a" vergibt einen Namen; at:{right_of|left_of|below|above: ref|id, gap?} legt neben ein Element; in: ref|id setzt in einen Rahmen; ganz ohne Angabe ordnen sich neue Elemente rechts neben dem Inhalt an (oder per layout).': 'Adds several elements at once (up to 1000). Arrows connect shapes via from/to (ref or id). layout arranges the new shapes automatically: {kind:"flow"|"tree"|"mindmap"|"radial"|"grid", direction?:"right"|"down"}. origin {x,y} sets the top-left corner. Returns refs → ids. Elements (JSON, coordinates in px, x/y = top left, y grows downwards):\n- Shapes: {type:"rect"|"ellipse"|"diamond", x, y, w, h, text?, fill?, stroke?, strokeWidth?, radius?, fontSize?, bold?, color?, sketch?:true (hand-drawn)}\n- Sticky note: {type:"sticky", text, fill? (#fff3a3 yellow, #ffc9de pink, #c5e4ff blue, #c3f0c8 green, #e5dbff purple, #ffd8a8 orange)}\n- Text: {type:"text", text, fontSize?, bold?, align?:"left"|"center"|"right", w? (wrap width)}\n- Arrow/line: {type:"arrow"|"line", from: ref|id, to: ref|id, text? (label), route?:"straight"|"elbow"|"curved", endHead?:"arrow"|"triangle"|"none", strokeStyle?:"dashed"} – stays attached to the shapes\n- Frame/artboard: {type:"frame", name, preset?:"desktop"|"mobile"|"tablet"|"social-square"|"social-portrait"|"social-landscape"|"story"|"a4"|"slide", w, h} – content with in: ref|id\n- Icon: {type:"icon", icon:"rocket"|"user"|"mail"|"phone"|"calendar-days"|"star"|"target"|"zap"|"lightbulb"|"euro"|"chart-column"|… , w, h, stroke?}\n- Table: {type:"table", cells:[["Header1","Header2"],["a","b"]], header?:true, w, h}\n- Chart: {type:"chart", chart:{kind:"bar"|"line"|"area"|"pie"|"donut", title?, labels:[…], series:[{name, values:[…]}]}, w?, h?}\n- Live CRM card: {type:"card", card:{kind:"contact"|"company"|"deal"|"task"|"ticket"|"appointment"|"project"|"report"|"pipeline", id}} (pipeline = whole board with stages)\n- Image: {type:"image", src:"/uploads/…" (from the media library), w, h}\nPlacement without coordinates: ref:"a" gives an element a name; at:{right_of|left_of|below|above: ref|id, gap?} places it next to an element; in: ref|id puts it into a frame; with no placement at all, new elements line up to the right of the existing content (or via layout).',
  'Board-ID (aus ghl_canvas_list)': 'Board ID (from ghl_canvas_list)',
