  'Canvas automatisch anordnen': 'Auto-arrange canvas',
  'Automatisches Layout (eigener Graph-Algorithmus): kind tree (Baum), flow (Fluss, links→rechts oder direction down), mindmap (Thema in der Mitte, Äste links/rechts), radial (Ringe) oder grid (Raster). Entweder vorhandene Elemente neu anordnen (ids; ohne ids alle Formen – Pfeile zwischen ihnen bestimmen die Struktur) oder neu zeichnen aus nodes [{id, label, shape?: rect|round|ellipse|diamond|sticky|pill, group?}] und edges [{from, to, label?}] (+ groups [{id,title}] → Rahmen, x/y = Position).': 'Automatic layout (own graph algorithm): kind tree, flow (left→right or direction down), mindmap (topic in the centre, branches left/right), radial (rings) or grid. Either rearrange existing elements (ids; without ids all shapes – the arrows between them define the structure) or draw anew from nodes [{id, label, shape?: rect|round|ellipse|diamond|sticky|pill, group?}] and edges [{from, to, label?}] (+ groups [{id,title}] → frames, x/y = position).',
  'Mermaid auf den Canvas': 'Mermaid to canvas',
